# ZERO orchestration interference observed (no Workflow-layer engagement, all
# spawns on-list, plugin flow faithful), so the pre-registered expectation of
# a criterion-4 failure was NOT confirmed. Verdict stays `max` because the
# runbook requires ultracode to pass all four fully-observed criteria AND
